{
  "title": "Imam al-Reza's supplication",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "يَا صَاحِبِيْ فِيْ شِدَّتِيْ وَ يَا وَلِيِّيْ فِيْ نِعْمَتِيْ وَ يَا اِلٰهِيْ وَ اِلٰهَ اِبْرَاهِيْمَ وَ اِسْمَاعِيْلَ وَ اِسْحَاقَ وَ يَعْقُوْبَ يَا رَبَّ كٓهٰيٓعٓصٓ وَ يٰسٓ وَ الْقُرْاٰنِ الْحَكِيْمِ اَسْاَلُكَ يَا اَحْسَنَ مَنْ سُئِلَ وَ يَا خَيْرَ مَنْ دُعِيَ وَ يَا اَجْوَدَ مَنْ اَعْطٰى وَ يَا خَيْرَ مُرْتَجًى اَسْاَلُكَ اَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ۔\nYAA SAAHIBEE FEE SHIDDATEE, WA YAA WALIYYEE FEE NI'MATEE, WA YAA ILAAHEE WA ILAAHA IBRAAHEEMA WA ISMAA-E'ELA WA ISHAAQA WA YA'QOOB, YAA RABBA KAAF-HAA-YAA-A'YN-SAAD, WA YAA-SEEN WAL QUR-AANIL HAKEEM, AS-ALUKA YAAA AHSANA MAN SU-IL, WA YAA KHAYRA MAN DU-I'YA, WA YAAA AJWADA MAN A'TAA, WA YAA KHAYRA MURTAJAA, AS-ALUKA AN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD.\nO my Companion in my hardship, O my Guardian in my blessing, O my God and the God of Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, and Jacob, O Lord of Kaf-Ha-Ya-Ayn-Sad and Ya-Sin and the wise Qur'an! I beseech You — O Most Excellent of those besought, O Best of those called upon, O Most Generous of those who give, O Best of those hoped in — I beseech You to bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad."
}
